# Real-time E-commerce Data Pipeline & Analytics Platform

A small data pipeline: order CSV files go into S3, a Lambda function cleans them, an ETL script loads them into an Oracle database, and a Flask API serves the results.

> **Note:** In Phase 1, AWS services (S3, Lambda) run locally using **LocalStack**, a free tool that copies AWS on your own computer. Nothing is deployed on real AWS yet.

