## How to Run (Phase 1)

1. Start the stack: `docker compose up -d`
2. Upload a CSV: `python3 etl/upload_to_s3.py data/raw_orders_2.csv`
3. Lambda cleans it automatically into `clean/`
4. Run the ETL to load it into Oracle
5. Open the API in a browser and check the results

